& [NestedValidationProof] is fail closed
  + [outer_first] profile and nonzero reconciliation identity reject before either nested validator
  + [pre_first] pre_read assembly always executes before post_read and its failure short circuits later work
  + [post_second] post_read failure is possible only after pre_read admission
  + [preservation] every nested wrapper retains the exact assembly fault plus one exact side
  + [bypass_absence] no public input accepts a preassembled observation

& [SyntaxIdentityProof] is exact and nonphysical
  + [reconciliation_identity] zero rejects and the admitted value is preserved
  + [entry_reference] both admitted values must be equal and nonzero
  + [batch] both admitted values must be nonzero and distinct
